This integration is built from the official Gladys Assistant JavaScript
integration template (https://github.com/GladysAssistant/integration-template-js,
Apache-2.0).

The collector drivers (endpoints, request parameters and answer formats of the
waste collectors' public APIs) are ported to JavaScript from the Home Assistant
"Afvalbeheer" custom component by pippyn and contributors
(https://github.com/pippyn/Home-Assistant-Sensor-Afvalbeheer, Apache-2.0).
